      "name": "Maps case/wallet",
      "slug": "maps-casewallet",
      "teaser": "A small wallet with 12 slots for maps; made to be used with Dynamic Maps \"Require a map in your inventory\" feature.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2525.png",
      "downloads": 3225,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p>– MOD WILL NOT BE UPDATED! USE <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2060/secure-mapbook\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2060/secure-mapbook</a> ITS NEWER AND HAS MORE FEATURES! –</p>\n<p>Just a small mod i’ve thrown together, originally for myself privately, but i thought why not make it public.</p>\n<p>All this does is add a wallet with 12 slots that exclusively takes maps and goes into secure containers and SICC case.</p>\n<p>It’s being sold by therapist from loyalty level 1 for 50k roubles.</p>\n<p>If you find any bugs don’t hesitate to let me know!</p>\n",
